            "number": "",
            "title": "Absolute Traceability",
            "title_uppercase": false,
            "text": "<p>We trace our wool and silks back to specific, certified ethical ranches. We believe knowing the hands that sheared, spun, and dyed the fabric is essential to genuine quality.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_4QNDen": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Slow-Weaving Loom Philosophy",
            "title_uppercase": false,
            "text": "<p>By employing historic shuttle looms in northern Italy, we weave at a fraction of modern industrial speeds. This gentle process respects the natural elasticity of raw cashmere.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_VKA7m3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Sculptural Permanence",
            "title_uppercase": false,
            "text": "<p>Our garments are engineered as wearable sculptures. We balance relaxed dropped shoulders with heavy, comforting structures designed to retain their form for decades.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
